<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Enum on 오깅중</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/tags/enum/</link><description>Recent content in Enum on 오깅중</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 15:42:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://jun7680.github.io/tags/enum/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>SwiftData #Predicate에서 enum 비교가 0건을 반환하는 이유</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swiftdata-predicate-enum-silent-zero/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 15:42:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swiftdata-predicate-enum-silent-zero/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;SwiftData 마이그 중에 디버깅 제일 빡셌던 게 &amp;ldquo;에러는 안 나는데 결과가 빈&amp;rdquo; 케이스였다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;scope&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ItemScopeType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;inbox&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;descriptor&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;FetchDescriptor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ItemEntity2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;predicate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;#&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Predicate&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;scope&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;scope&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;results&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;descriptor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// results.count == 0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;DB엔 분명히 &lt;code&gt;scope = .inbox&lt;/code&gt;인 row가 100건 들어있다. 근데 predicate는 0건을 반환한다. throw도 없고, 로그도 없다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>